[claude:event result] {"duration_api_ms":133452,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0c0e50d4-7cd8-46da-8f89-fd8f99a7d227","total_cost_usd":0.13803275,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21977,"cache_read_input_tokens":26765,"output_tokens":21324,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":20321},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21977},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":365,"cache_read_input_tokens":13854,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21034,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21034,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1158,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001248,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":21324,"cacheReadInputTokens":26765,"cacheCreationInputTokens":21977,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.13678475,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":20321,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":2,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Done! I've saved the regex pattern to `/app/regex.txt`. \n\nThe pattern works as follows:\n\n1. **`(?:^|[^a-zA-Z0-9])`** — Matches either line start or a non-alphanumeric character before the IP\n2. **IPv4 address** — Validates each octet is 0-255 with no leading zeros, surrounded by non-alphanumeric boundaries\n3. **`.*?`** — Non-greedy match of any characters between IP and date\n4. **`(?<![a-zA-Z0-9])`** — Ensures date isn't preceded by alphanumeric (word boundary check)\n5. **Date capture group** — `(\\d{4}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]))`\n6. **`(?![a-zA-Z0-9])`** — Ensures date isn't followed by alphanumeric\n7. **`(?!.*\\d{4}-...(?![a-zA-Z0-9]))`** — Negative lookahead ensuring this is the LAST valid date on the line\n\nWhen used with `re.findall(pattern, log_text, re.MULTILINE)`, it returns a list of dates (the captured group) from lines containing valid IPv4 addresses.","ttft_ms":129138,"type":"result","duration_ms":132668,"uuid":"fa692917-c505-4252-adcf-bb6e0faa5fa3","ttft_stream_ms":1039,"time_to_request_ms":42,"queued_turn_count":0}
